        "## Part 3: if, elif, and else\n",
        "### Triage\n",
        "\n",
        "Triage sorts patients by urgency. An `if`, `elif`, `else` chain checks conditions from the top and runs only the first one that is True. Note that `elif` is not a loop. The chain runs once and picks one path.\n",
